00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:22.000
<v Chris>resolve, a relationship to walk out from, a passage

91
00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.500
<v Chris>that means roughly the same, or plain lexical text.

92
00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.720
<v Chris>The same statement form for all of them, through one

