00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:32.040
<v Christina>And when none of those is what I want?

94
00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:36.380
<v Chris>Then you write SQL, and there's no keyword for it. A

95
00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.980
<v Chris>statement that starts with select is recognised by how

96
00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:42.060
<v Chris>it starts, and it runs read-only, under the same

