00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.880
<v Chris>row-level security you have everywhere else. SQL is

98
00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.360
<v Chris>the floor the modes sit on rather than a mode of its

99
00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:48.900
<v Chris>own.

100
00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:52.380
<v Christina>Why have the layer at all? People know SQL.

101
00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.720
<v Chris>It isn't written for people. It's written so a model

