<v Chris>half-remembered name and a vague question at the same

104
00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:04.800
<v Chris>time, and here those are the same kind of thing — one

105
00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.260
<v Chris>statement with a different word on the front.

106
00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.900
<v Christina>How does it know what any of that means in my

107
00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.800
<v Christina>database, though? It hasn't read my documentation.

108
00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:18.040
<v Chris>It asks. SCHEMA is the mode for that — the facets, the

109
00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.220
<v Chris>entity types, the relations, which embedding models

